        "does": "The Power Functions XL motor drives the crane's four functions one at a time: the battery box's switch turns it on, the red lever with a towball handle (on the polarity switch) sets its direction, and two yellow levers on the right of the gearbox choose which function it drives (each lever up or down, or both in the middle for none).",
